    - Backpropagation calculates gradients.
    - Adam is an optimization algorithm.
    - Binary Cross-Entropy is commonly used as the loss function for binary classification.
    - Epoch represents one complete pass through the training dataset.
    - Neural Networks can learn complex linear and nonlinear relationships.

